*
* Ideal rail-tracking drivers for the DUT inputs (DR-007: ideal).
BD0   d0    0 V = v(vccd)*v(p0)
BD0B  d0b   0 V = v(vccd)*(1 - v(p0))
BD1   d1    0 V = v(vccd)*v(p1)
BD1B  d1b   0 V = v(vccd)*(1 - v(p1))
BCLK  clk   0 V = v(vccd)*v(pclk)
